    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manaulyn takes place on an Earth abandoned by Humans and taken over by Mythicals, creatures of folklore. Follow the moose or wolf as they search for their missing friend after a failed patrol to gather materials and magic water for the town. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cManaulyn\u201d is an action-adventure game in a fantasy-dystopian world. As a single-player mode game, the player can play as a moose or wolf to rescue a lost friend. The player has to survive the enemies living in the woods while searching for the missing friend. Mythicals will attack the character until they reach a dead end, where a lake holding magical water is guarded by both a hydra and a kraken. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player, using the mouse and keyboard, can also use magic to combat any foes who dare to try and stop the player from achieving their goal. At the end of their journey, the main character will obtain the needed materials for their town and hopefully find their friend.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manaulyn takes place on an Earth abandoned by Humans and taken over by Mythicals, creatures of folklore. Follow the moose or wolf as they search for their missing friend after a failed patrol to gather materials and magic water for the town. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cManaulyn\u201d is an action-adventure game in a fantasy-dystopian world. As a single-player mode game, the player can play as a moose or wolf to rescue a lost friend. The player has to survive the enemies living in the woods while searching for the missing friend. Mythicals will attack the character until they reach a dead end, where a lake holding magical water is guarded by both a hydra and a kraken. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player, using the mouse and keyboard, can also use magic to combat any foes who dare to try and stop the player from achieving their goal. At the end of their journey, the main character will obtain the needed materials for their town and hopefully find their friend.</p>",
    "short_description": "An action-adventure game based around a moose or wolf rescuing a lost friend from a hydra and kraken. Shoot magic at the mythicals and take them out as you explore the forests of an abandoned Earth. Defeat the Kraken and Hydra to win the day.",
